{"unit_id":"tag:041I:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们始终假设所有概形（schemes）都包含在一个大（big）fppf 位点（site）<MATH_0001> 中，所考虑的所有环（rings）<MATH_0002> 都满足：<MATH_0003> 同构（isomorphic）于这个大（big）位点（site）的某个对象（object）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0004> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0005> 是代数空间（algebraic space），其基底为 <MATH_0006>。本章及后续章节中，我们用 <MATH_0007> 表示 <MATH_0008> 与自身的积（product）（在 <MATH_0009> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）中），而不用 <MATH_0010>。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"固定约定所涉及的概形；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"大fppf位点的大小条件；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"固定的fppf位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"所考虑的环；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"环对应的概形与位点对象的关系；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"大位点中的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"代数空间的基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定的代数空间；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积","context":"与自身的积的记号约定；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"构造积的范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"积所在的范畴；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W2:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。上面的引理告诉我们，关于以 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 为目标的映射（maps）族的下降（descent）资料的范畴（categories）之间，有一个良定义的拉回（pullback）函子（functor），只要这些映射（maps）族之间有一个“位于 <MATH_0004> 之上”的态射（morphism）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定态射所涉及的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"代数空间间及映射族间的态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"具有固定目标的映射族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"相对于映射族的下降资料；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"两族的下降资料范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"下降资料的拉回构造；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"下降资料范畴间的函子；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W7:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n模（modules）的平坦（flat）下降（descent）的主要应用，是拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）关于 fpqc 覆盖（coverings）的相应下降（descent）陈述。\n\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"平坦下降的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"下降的类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"平坦下降及相应的下降陈述；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"主要应用中的层；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"fpqc覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
